# pop'n music 14 FEVER!, NET TAISEN between two HIRAKU cabinets on one LAN cable (lancable.h),
# as popn12-nettaisen-a/-b.his: each from a save with e-AMUSEMENT on (popn14-eamuse-on.his; no event
# phase needed: 13 and 14 open the mode with game get's net_event 2), each with its own
# e-AMUSEMENT PASS (-card0: A E004010000001401, B E004010000001402). A new card's credit as
# popn14-card-new.his up to the name; the mode wheel one to the left (Button 4) to NET対戦, red; the
# explainer skipped (red); ROOM SELECT, a second explainer and JOB SELECT to their timers; song
# select while the lobby looks. A waits in the lobby, B (300 frames behind) joins it; MATCHING shows
# both players and a CPU; the song starts on both at once, each player pressing a button every 10
# frames (A from button 1, B from 5), and both RESULTs have all three scores.
game popn14
at 4500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4700 press "P1 Button 5" 8
at 5050 press "Card" 8
at 5300 press "Keypad 1" 8
at 5330 press "Keypad 2" 8
at 5360 press "Keypad 3" 8
at 5390 press "Keypad 4" 8
at 5700 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 6000 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 6060 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 6120 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 12400 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 12500 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 12900 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 13100 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 22000 snap   # MATCHING: the opponents
at 25600 snap   # the battle
at 29200 snap   # RESULT
